],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 58% of normal in October to November and 55% of normal in November to December of 2025. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 49% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 19409 had its driest year in 2007 at 67%.</p>"}
